## Order type registry: the 67-entry table TotalA.exe builds at startup (0x403180, 0x406bf0, 0x415b20 -> 0x43bc90).
## Ids are indices of the stricmp-sorted table (A-Z folded only). Handlers and draw routines are kept as their native
## addresses (ids only; no behaviour). Verified by tools/native_order_queue.py (native build == static parse) and
## godot/compare_native_order_queue.gd. Status strings stay in local/orders/order-table.json (not tracked).

